    "status": "present",
    "value": "Generate n NFTs with duplicates allowed. For each NFT and each trait in order, take the next random r and choose values[r mod len(values)]. randoms has exactly n * len(traits) entries. Randomness is injected: randoms is a deterministic list of non-negative integers (each <= 10^15) consumed in order. Each NFT is returned as the list of chosen values in trait order."
  },
